    (uuid "71b71beb-798b-5e2d-bc11-efaeb9651c09")
  )
  (text "Pin map: XMOS XVF3800 v3.2.1 Tables 4.1 and 6.1. QF60B has FOUR core-supply paddles plus one ground paddle.\n61-64 must connect to 0.9 V; 65 is ground. The local five-paddle footprint follows Fig.8.1 nominal geometry.\nUSB ESD, exact connector, XTAG4 adapter, land-pattern/stencil review and firmware remain release tasks."
    (at 15 24 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "40c922e7-a981-5c9d-8755-a66d66e8a95b")
